Rotok is a half-orc cleric of Tempus and one of the three founders of [[Org/Sedecium|Sedecium]], alongside [[People/Dorcan|Dorcan]] and [[People/Zugg|Zugg]]. He was not immortal: he kept refusing Zugg's attempts to make him so, wanting rest after a lifetime of fighting.

An old friend of his, a freedom fighter, drew the party into the war in [[Geography/Ushas/Penthes|Penthes]]. After the party killed [[Divinity/Unknown Entities/Mephistopheles|Mephistopheles]], Rotok founded a church to his god that spanned the globe, improving the lives of all and spreading the influence of [[Geography/Ushas/New Volcantum|Volcantum]].
